<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>斑疹 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%96%91%E7%96%B9/</link><description>Recent content in 斑疹 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 16:09:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%96%91%E7%96%B9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>斑疹</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-16-banzhen/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 16:05:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-16-banzhen/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“斑疹”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论热郁肌表、火不得尽泄所致斑疹的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;身热即冷、满体生斑如疹，乃火郁于内、不得尽泄于外，不可纯用寒凉直折，当滋阴降火、升散透发，使郁火外达而斑自消&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>